@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@ debuglink CRCs for every deployed ELF and GDB source-line lookup after adding th
 debug TAR. Native AMD64 and ARM64 jobs run the independent registry consumer.
 
 ```sh
-python3 ci/registry_ci.py run --module p4lang-bmv2 --version 1.15.0.sonic.2 \
+python3 ci/registry_ci.py run --module p4lang-bmv2 --version 1.15.0.sonic.3 \
